msgctxt "64"
msgid "You're fired!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Whaaaaat!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Are you stupid!? You can't just let people leave and\r\n"
"\"pay later\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I'm taking our losses out of your wages. Good grief...\r\n"
"We're short on staff as it is. Damn it all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Oh... Kiryu-san. I got fired again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Yeah, I saw."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I can't even cut it at a bowling alley... I've probably\r\n"
"been fired from every place in Kamurocho that'll hire me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Well, this being Kamurocho, you could always try the clubs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Clubs, huh? I do enjoy my liquor. That's not a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I love chatting with customers, too. I'll look into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Thanks! Kiryu-san, if you're ever in a rough spot, you can always count on "
"me."
msgstr ""

